# Missing Number
# Idea: To find the missing number in an array containing distinct numbers from 0 to n, we can use the XOR operation. We XOR all the numbers from 0 to n and then XOR the result with all the elements in the array. The XOR operati…
# Line comments below keep the same logic as the NeetCode 150 repo solution.

class Solution:
    def missingNumber(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:
        n = len(nums)
        missing_num = n

        for i in range(n):
            missing_num ^= i ^ nums[i]

        return missing_num
